WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS
========================

The MIT licence below applies to the SOURCE CODE in this repository: the
components, hooks, utilities, build configuration, tests, and the drawn SVG
marks authored here. Take it, change it, ship it, sell it.

It does NOT cover the personal content, which is reserved:

  - the name, biography, photographs and likeness of Sathish Kumar
  - the written copy: role descriptions, project write-ups, the CV, and the
    text of public/llms.txt
  - the project outcomes and any figures attributed to them

Those are a person's professional record. Reuse the code to build your own
portfolio; please do not republish someone else's work history as your own.

Third-party assets keep their own licences. Brand marks generated from the
`simple-icons` package are CC0, but the trademarks they depict belong to their
respective owners and are used here only to identify those products. The
typefaces (Barlow, Newsreader, JetBrains Mono) are licensed under the SIL Open
Font License by their authors.

If you build something from this, a link back is appreciated but not required.
A starting point for doing exactly that is in
`3d_portfolio/docs/BUILD-THIS-YOURSELF.md`.


